<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">1 P'et'ros</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 P'et'ros</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 P'et'ros Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 P'et'.</para>
  <para style="mt">Wosheetso P'et'ros Shints Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosh na'o P'et'eros woshts wosh shintso b́ guut'e b́ woshotse «Ik'o marat' b́dek'ts ashuwotsi» ett s'egeyirwotsnat múk'na'a Isiyotsere gaar maantsi kayotse bad'wtsts krstiyaniwotssha, b́ woshotsi een k'os'onwere bo imneti jangosh gishewonat gond bek'on boats bodts nababirwotsi kúp'shonat t'engoyosha, guut'tso han b́ k'aluere b́ k'iro, k'irt b́ tuwo, aanar b́weetwok'osh jangiyetso daniyitwo Iyesus Krstos doo shishiyi aap'o nababirwotssh gawiyosha, Iyesus Krstos beyo ariyetsok'o woshde'r s'iilr gond bek'o k'amoon dek'o boosh b́ geyitwok'owa boosh b́ gawiyiri, hanton deshidek't gond bek'o bo imnetyo s'ayinfre bíamo fadeyarr «Iyesus Krstos b́ be'et aawots» boosh wotit k'awntso bo dek'etwok'o boosh b́ kitsiri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Guut'tso gond bek'o bo k'amitwok'o kúp'iyoniyere k'osho nababirwots Krstos shuutso sha'irwots beyo boosh b́ geyit narok'o wotar bobetwok'owe boosh b́ gawiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik' kashiyo gawiyetso 1:3-12</para>
  <para style="io1">S'ayin wotts kashon beyosh imets izo 1:13—2:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Kic'or Krstiyaniwots boatse geyetwo 2:11—4:19</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyani maac'nefonat bo fino 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 5:12-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Iyesus Krstossh wosheets wottso P'et'rosoke, ib wotat P'ant'osn, Gelatiyon, K'ep'edok'iyon, Isiyon, Bitiniyon bad'aat beyirwotssh, <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Ik'o niho bali b́dantsok'on marat'etswotssh, Iyesus Krstossh alewosh, b́ s'atson fakeyar s'ayonosh, S'ayin shayiron s'ayintseyat galertee, itsh s'aatonat jeenon ankatowe.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beyar bewosh jangiyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Iyesus Krstos k'irotse b́ tuwi jangon jamaaw beyosh wititwo jangiyetso noosh imtso, b́ mhreti ayon handr shuwewo noosh imtso, no doonz Iyesus Krstos nihi Ik'o údewe, <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Bíwere t'afrawo, aawasherawonat gawereraw rstiyo darotse itsh k'anire. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Itwere s'uwaatsi aawots be'et kasho imneti weeron Ik' angon koteertee. <verse eid="1PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Dab ay naari fadewwots múk' aawwotssh iti boshiyaniyo ooreratse wotiyaloru amanat it kashtsosh gene'ore. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Fadeyan itats b́bodir it imnetiyo arik b́ wotok'o kitsoshe, t'afit awntsonwor dab tawone b́ fadefoni, awntsoniyere bogo k'awnts detsts it imnetiyonmo hank'o fadeyo bísh geyife, it imneti arik wottsanwere Iyesus Krstos b́ be'ewor údon, mangonat iti k'ees'iyeyo itsh daatsitwe. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Iyesus Krstosi be'atste wotiyaloru bín shunfte, dab andoor bín bek'o it k'azaloru bín amanirute, hank'oyi err falr keewerawnat mangts gene'on geneeúwirutee. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>It amantsatse tuutso it kotirwo it kashu woro daatsitwte.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Kashi jangansh itsh wotit s'aato bek'on keewts nebiyatiyots aydek' geeyat p'ec'ar s'iilo woshrne. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Boyitse beyiru Krstos shayiro Mesihiyo ats bodet gond bek'o, gond beek'oniyere okoon b́ daatsit mango shini kitsre b́ teshi, boowere jaman awri gizeyonat aawk'on b́ wotitwok'o p'ec'at s'ilrne bo teshi, <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Nebiyiyanots bofinir itsha bako botokosh b́ woterawok'o boosh be'ere b́ teshi, bo finwere darotse wosheets S'ayin shayiri weeron dooshishiyo itsh keewts ashuwots itsh bokeewtso bek'shoone, keewanowere melakiwotswor dab bek'osh tewnroone bo teshi.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ayinon beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Mansh eshe it nibo káátsde'er finosh k'ande'ere, Iyesus Krstos b́ be'et aawots it daatsit s'aatosh s'een wotts jángiyo deshere. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Aleyiru nanaúwotsi wotarr bali dáron it detsts gond tewni jafrats sha'ak'ayere, <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>ernmó itn s'eegts Ik'o S'ayin b́ wottsok'o itwere it be jamon S'ayin wotoore, <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lew. 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref> </char></note> «Taa S'ayin t wottsok'o itwere S'ayin wotoore» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Konshoru b́ boga bogshrawo ik ikosh b́ finok'o angishitu Ik'o «Nonihi» etaat it s'eegirwo b́ wottsotse datsanatse ib wotat itbeyirwotse bín shatoon beewere,. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>It it nihwotsatse it naatts woteraw beyatse itn kéwe t'afit ambaron wee awntson b́woterawok'o danfte. <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>Itn aani kéwédek'e eeg eeg kim deshaw wee ik shap deshaw mereer wottso mangts Krstos s'atsone. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Bíwere b́ dane datsan b́ azeraftsere shinon b́ wotor ando s'uwaatsi dúranatsere itsh be'ere. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>It imnetiyonat it jangitwon Ik'ats b́ wotitwok'o Iyesus weeron bín k'irotse tiztsonat bísh mang imts Ik'on amanitute.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Amantsuwotssh kááwon s'eents shuno it detsetwok'o aroosh alewosh it kashu kup'shdek'rte, mansh eshe it nibi s'eenon it ats atsewo ayide shunewere. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Gitlo it shuuwe beyar beetwo dúre dúron ned'itu Ik'o aap'on t'afraw shokona bako tafitwonaliye. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Mas'aafo b́ etirwok'on;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">«Meets tahats jamo totsok'owiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">B́ mang jamonwere boditsi fundok'owiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">Totsonwere shuuk'etwe, fundonwere ooshetwe,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24-25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa. 40:6-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzo aap'tsonmó</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:25">Dúre dúrosh kúp'ar beetwe.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Itsh nabets dooshishiy keewonwere haniye.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Beyar beet shutsonat s'ayin ashuwotsn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Eshe gond jámo, dirsh jamo, ats dáro, okooro, konnari óóno wokiwere, <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>And shuwets na'auots ez gooro bo tewnfok'o itwere kashon eenfere it amish s'ayin wotts shayiri dano tewnwere. <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 33:8">Dub. 33:8</ref> </char></note> Tewnosh it falitwere «Doonzo tewd doo b́ wottsok'o shashwerte wotiyale.»<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Mansh beyar beetk shúts wottso doonzo Iyesus maants t'inere, shútsanwere ashuwots gac'at bok'ztso, Ik'oknomó bín b́ marat'etsonat mangits k'awnts detstsoniye. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Doonzo Iyesus maants it t'iinet beyar beet shútsok'o Shayiri moo wotarr agewoshe, hank'on Iyesus Krstos weeron geneúshit shayiri wosho Ik'osh t'intsosh S'ayin Kahniyotsi wotitute. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref> </char></note> S'ayin mas'aafotse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">«Hambe! marat'etsonat mang wotts</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Tungúshatse shútsuwotsi kaatsde detset shuuts kup' S'iyonits beezitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">bín amanitwo b́jamon jitseratse»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:6">etts aap'o guut'eyatniye b́ fa'oni. <verse eid="1PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Dub. 118:22</ref> </char></note> Eshe it amanirwotssh shútsan mangkee, amanerawwotsshomó</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">«Gmbi agirwots gac'at bojuuts shútso tungúshatse shutswotsi kaatsde detset shúts kúp'o b́ woti.»<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa. 8:14-15</ref> </char>
    </note> Ando aani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">«Ashuwotsi gandit shútso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">hambe! ashuwotssh t'ug wotar dikit shúts s'aloni» etfe.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Bowere bí aap'tso amano bok'aztsosh dihitúne, shinonowere hansh beezekne.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Kesh. 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20-21">Isa. 43:20-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Iwi. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa. 9:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Itmó t'alwotsere adits shááno maants iti s'eegts Ik'oko adits fino it nabitwok'o marat'ets shuwetswots, nugúso Kahniwots, Ik'o b́ tookosh woshb́dek'ts S'ayin ash itne. <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos. 2:23</ref> </char></note> It bal Ik' ashuwotsiliye itteshi, andomó Ik' ashuwotsi woterte, yoots máác' k'ewo daatsatste b́ teshi, andomó máác' k'ewo daatsrte.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' guutswots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>T eshwotso! datsanatsere ibwotsnat ash datsi ashuwotsi it wottsotse kashonton kaareyiru meetsi tewnotse it wokitwok'o oona itsha etirwe. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Daneraka «Gond finirwotsiye» err itn bo oniyaloru dab Ik'o noon s'ilosh b́ weet aawots Ik' ash woterawwots it sheeng fino be'er Ik'o bo uditwok'o bo dagotse it beyor sheeng doyo it detsetwok'owa.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Doonzo Iyesus Krstossha err ashaatsere naashts jamwotssh alewere, dambaan bogt naash b́wottsotse naashi naashosh alewere. <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>Dats k'eezirwotssho alewere, bo gond finirwotsi sezosh, sheeng finirwotsi udosh naashi naashoke wosheekne. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Sheengo finar dartswots bodari aap'otse s'k bo etetwok'o it k'alo Ik'i shune. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Ik' guutswotskok'o wotar s'ayinon beewere bako it s'ayin beyo gondo bín ipoosh woshk'ayere. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Ash jamo mangiwere, amants eshwotsi shunere, Ik'o sharere, nugúso mangiwere.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos gond bek'on ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Guutswotso itwere it doonz doonzosh mangiyon keewewere, it kewetwerere shengwotsnat doowwots s'uznsh b́ woterawo gondwotsshor keewewere. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Asho s'aato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">S'aato: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grikiwots noon keew keewon </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Deera </char><char style="ft">Etirwo udoniye. </char></note> b́daatsit, weeralon gondbek'o bíyats b́ bodor Ik'osha err b́ k'amitkawotiyale. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Gondo finar sezewo de'er it k'amiyal eegi úde it datsiti? Ernmó sheengo finar it eree gondo itbek'oor it k'amiyal Ik'oke údo daatsitute. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>It s'egewwor manshe, b́ jafrats it sháitwok'o Krstos itsh gondo bek'osh ariyetso wotere. <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa. 53:9</ref> </char></note> Bíwere eegoru morro fineratse, b́ noonotsnowere kooto keyatse. <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref> </char></note> C'asheworowere aanidek't c'ayatse, gondo b́bek'orowere kááwon angshitwo Izar Izewersh b́ tooko oona! ett b́ imi bako sheeferatse. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa. 53:5</ref> </char></note> Morratse k'iron k'alewok'o k'alewon k'aleyar kááwon nobetwok'o bí b́ tookon b́ meetson no morro jitatse kur b́ dek'i, b́ gaawon kashwtserte. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa. 53:6</ref> </char></note> It t'afts mereerwotskok'o it dandefra it teshi, andomó it kashu jinirwonat kotirwok k'az aanertee.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kenihe mets jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe. 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">K'ol. 3:18</ref> </char>
    </note> Mank'o it máátswotso! it kenih kenihosh alewere, hank'on ik ikwots Ik' keewtso amanerak bowotiyaloru dab bo máátswots ik noono bo keewawo bo doy mec'ron geetsewosh falitune. <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>Geetsewosh bofalitwere s'ayin wottsonat ash mangitk wotts it beyo bo bek'ore. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 T'im. 2:9</ref> </char></note> It azsheengo took wozewon, awnts gedon, k'awnts shaawon kéwets tah tahon úratse be'eyiru baatson wotk'aye. <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Ernmó it azsheengo Ik' shinatse b́ k'awntso ayidek't mangtsonat t'afraw s'ilalon, maac' nefonat s'k etts shayiron baatstso, nibotse ááshat beyiru gitsitsi atson wotowe. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Yoots dúron bo Ik'o jangat bokeewo bíats juuk'rts, S'ayin máátswots bo baatso hank'one b́ teshi, bo kenih kenihwosh bo alefere b́ teshi. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Aze. 18:12</ref> </char></note> Bo alewwere Sara Abrahamsh «T doonzo!» etaat bísh bi alefi naare, itwere sheeng wotts jamo it k'aliyal eegoru itn shatit keewo iti tek'iyo b́ k'azal b nanaúwots itne.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe. 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">K'ol. 3:19</ref> </char>
    </note> It kenihwotso! it máátswotsnton t'iwintson ik wotar beewere,, itiyere bogo maawk bowottsotse itnton kashon beyi s'aato bo naatetwotse boon mangiwere, hank'onowere it Ik' k'onosh t'ug wotit keewo beeratse.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sheengo finar gondbek'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Eshe it únets it ats atsatseyo ikwotar beewere,, k'osh ash kic'o it kic'ok'o woshde'er taawwere, eshwi shunon shunewere, maac' k'ewetswotsnat took dashan detstswotsi wotoore. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Deerwere bako gondi shegro gondon, c'ashi shegro c'ashon anik'ayere, it its'eege han itk'alishe. Han k'alrnwere deero naatetute, <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>S'ayin Mas'aafo b́ etirwok'o;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">«B́bewotse gene'úo geyirwonat sheeng aawwotsi bek'osh geyirwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">Bí albero gond keewo b́ keewawok'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">b́ noono weeri gondo b́ keewawok'o baziwe.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Gondatse wokowe, sheeng keewo finowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">Jeenono geyowe, b́jafratsowere sha'owe <verse eid="1PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Dub. 34:12-16</ref> </char></note> Doonzo ááwwots</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">kááwwots maantse bo s'iliri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">b́ waazwotswere bo k'ontso k'eboosh k'eshekne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">gond fonirwotsatsomó</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Doonzo b́shits aak'on shet'etwe.»<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Sheeng keewo k'alosh it kúp'iyal gondo itats betsitwo kone? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat. 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa. 8:12-13</ref> </char></note> Sheeng keewo finar it eree gond bek'o itats b́ bodalmó deero daatsitute, boon shatk'ayere, kic'ono kic' k'ayere. <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Doonzo Krstosi it níbon mangiwere, it kashosh doonzo woshde'er, itokere fa'a it jangiyetsmansh itn aatiru jamwotssh aaniyosh jam aawo k'andek'tswotsi wotoore. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>It aanitwonmo nooni nefonat mangiyon wotowe, Krstosk it wottsosh it detsts sheeng doyats gond keewiru ashuwots bo gond keewon bo jitsitwok'o maac' s'ayino deshere. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Ik' shunotso b́ wotiyal it gond fino finar gondo itbek'oniyere sheeng keewo finar gondo it bek'o k'anefe. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Krstos b́ tookon Ik'o maants iti t'intsosh bí kááw wotefetst kááw woterawwotssh morratse tuutson aani iwisherawok'on iknoto gondo bek't k'irre, bí meetson k'irre, shayironomó beyar beetke b́ woshi. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Shayir mannowere tipi mootse beyiru kashuwotsok amt dooshishiyo b́ nabi. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Aze. 6:1—7:24</ref> </char></note> Tipi mootse beyiru shayr shayirwots yoots Noh dúr markabo b́ dozor Ik'o boon k'amoon b́ kotfere aleratsone ettswotsiye. Markabmanits kindt aatsotse kashtswots botaawo shmt ash wotts múk' ashuwots s'uziye. <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Atsanwere and itn kashitu gupon ariyetsoniye, gupanu atsatsi kiimo bazosh b́ woterawo s'ayin maac'o daatsosh Ik'o maants t'iinet k'ononiye, itn b́ kashitwere Iyesus Krstos k'irotse b́ tuutsi weerone, <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>Bí daro maants amt Ik'o k'anokee, melakiwotsnat alirwots, angwotswor, bísh keewernee.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'i shunok'on bobetwok'o b́ iztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Krstos b́meetson gond bek'o b́ datstsosh itwere kes'i taho taahadek'ts ashok'o hasabiyanats k'up'ar k'ande'ere, b́meetson gond bek'o dek'ts asho morro fino need'ik'rere.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft">Krstos b́meetson gondo b́ bek'tsosh morro ango b́ deshawok'o woshre. </char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Haniyakon eshe oorts datsatsi it beyon meetsi gond tewno s'eentson b́ woterawo Ik'i shuntsok'on beewere. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Ik' ash woterawwots bo k'alfok'o shiraatse jintsi woton, gusiyon, máshon, werali gáálon, weralo úyide'er duubonat wic'ik wotts dozets ik'uwotsi ik'iyon it beshits dúro bodfe. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Andomó keewann weralo bonton ik woton beshiyo it k'aztsosh bo adiri, bo c'ashiri. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Ernmó kashon fa'úwotsnat k'irtswotsats angshosh k'andek'tso shinatse aatetúne. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Eshé hank'on boowere ash jamikok'o bomeetson bok'iritwok'o boats angshere, ernmó boshayron Ik'ok'o beyar beetwotsi wotar bobetwok'o doo shishiyo k'irtswotssh nabere.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' imts imuwotsi sheengshde'e boon k'eezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Eshe jam keewi s'uwo bodre, kup'arr Ik' k'ono it falitwok'o mangdek'ts nibo deshere, it angok'owere beewere,. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Ari. 10:12</ref> </char></note> Shuno morri ayo b́ aatsitwotse jamoniyere bogo it ats atseyo kúp'shde'er shunewere. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Múmúderaniyere it ats atseyon ibo ibiwere. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>K'osh k'osh naari Ik'i s'aatwotsi sheengsh k'eezfetsr ititse ik iko bísh imets s'aaton k'oshosh finowe. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Danirwo Ik' aap'o b́ danirwok'on daniwe, finirwonu Ik'o bísh b́ imet angon finowe, hank'on Ik'o Iyesus Krstos weeron jam keewon mangitwe, mangonat angon dúre dúrosh bísh wotowe, amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gondbek'otse kup'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>T mashotso! tawok'o fadit gond bek'otse it daatsewo daneraw ib wotts keewo itats b́ bodtsok'o woshde'er adk'ayere, <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Maniyere dab Krstos mangon b́ be'ewor ayde'er it geneútiwok'o b́ gond bek'otse kaydek'tswotsi it wottsok'o gene'owere. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Krstos shúútsi jangosh it c'asheyal mang wotts Shayiro etonwere Ik' Shayiro itats b́ oot'etwotse derek itne. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Ititsere konworu gondo b́ bek'or kash úd'tsok'o, úmp'etsok'o, gond fintsok'o, ash keewots s'eegerawo kindirwok'o wotk'aye. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Krstiyani b́ wottsatse tuutson gondbek'o bíyats bodetwonmó krstiyaniyat b́ s'egetsosh Ik'o mangiwa bako jitsk'aye.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Man eegoshe? Angsho b́ tuwit aawo bodre, angshonú b́tuwit Ik' ashuwotsatsne, eshe angsho b́ tuwit noyitsna wotiyal Ik' doo shishiyosh aleraw ashuwots bo s'uwo aawk'owe b́ wotitik'úna? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Ari. 11:31</ref> </char></note> S'ayin mas'aafotse b́ etirwok'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">«Kááwonúwor dab kasho b́ falit k'ic'ona wotiyal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">Ik' Ik'irawotsnat morrets ashuwots aawk'owe bowotiti?»<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Mansh Ik' shunok'on gond bek'iru ashuwots bokeew jamo azts amanetsosh adaro imr sheeng keewo k'alosh shuutsan etk'ayne.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' ashuwotsi bín k'eezosh imets izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Eshe taa bonton tohaat Ik' meyitsi eenash wottso, Krstos gond bek'osh gaw wottso, ando shino maantsish be'et mango kayitk wottso, it dagotse beyiru Ik' máá eenashwotsi izitwe. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Yoh. 21:15-17</ref> </char></note> Adaro itsh imets Ik' gizi s'eeno jinere, gizi s'eenmanowere it jinet angnon b́ woterawo Ik'o b́ getsok'on, shunon wotowe, ambarosh k'awnton b́ woterawo finosh it detsts shunon wotowe. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Mank'o it naashi shirotse beyirwotsi fiic'de'er kéwon b́ woterawo Ik' giz s'enwotssh sheeng ariyo kitson wotowe. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Hank'o it k'aliyal jints eeno b́ be'ewor awaasheraw mangi akliliyo dek'etute.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:34">Ari. 3:34</ref> </char>
    </note> Ando! it jawetswotso! eenashúwotssh alewere, it jamets maac' nefo tahok'o tahade'er iko ikosh finowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">«Ik'o bog taana etirwotsi k'efitwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">botoko dashan detsetwotsshomó s'aato imetwe» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="1PE 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk'. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe Ik'o b́ etts aawon itn dambaan b́ tuzish Ik' kishi kúp'o shirots it tooko dashan deshere. <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Bí itsh b́ shiyanirwotse iti kic'iru shiyan jamo bíyats juuk'rore.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>It detstson beewere,, k'ande'ere! it balangaro diyablos b́ k'ot'etwo geefetst guundiru ééshok'o it gúúratse b́ ananiri. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Dats jamatse fa'a it eshúwots han naari gond bek'o bo dek'irwok'o dande'er it amantsats kúp'ar imnetyon bín k'efoore. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Muk' gizewosh gondo it bek'iyakon Krstosn dúre dúri mango maants iti s'eegtso s'aat jami Ik'o bí b́ tookon iti s'eenwotsi woshitwe, iti tep'etwe, iti kup'itwe, iti need'itwe. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Dúre dúrosh b́ borfetso ango bísh wotowe! amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:22">Wosh. 15:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Amanets eshwe etaat t gawirwo Silas weeron woshan k'awnon itsh guut're, itsh t guut'uwere itsh t izirwan ari Ik' s'aato b́ wotok'o itsh gawoosha etaatniye, mansh Ik' s'aatanotsatse kúp'ar need'ore.<verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Wosh. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:35-39">15:35-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">K'ol. 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref> </char>
    </note> Itkok'o marat'dek'etsu Babilonitse fa'a Ik'i moow jamo itsh t'intsirwane, t naa'yi Mrk'oswere jamo itsh t'intsirwe. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Krstiyaniwots shunon it ats atseyo jobeyon jamo aatewere.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Krstosk wotts it únetssh jeeno wotowe.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
